OL,3,GNEWSANo time for new minister to fix
OL,4,Ahealth service warns top doctor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLagan Valley Ulster Unionist assembly
OL,7,Fmember Robbie Butler was announced as
OL,8,Fthe new health minister on Thursday.
OL,9,FThis follows the resignation of his
OL,10,Fparty colleague Mike Nesbitt from the
OL,11,Fpost.
OL,13,FAn emergency meeting of Stormont's
OL,14,Fhealth committee is also due to take
OL,15,Fplace on Thursday to discuss the fall
OL,16,Fout from Nesbitt's resignation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
